cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite the paper."
title: "SGRD — reproduction and verification code"
abstract: >-
  Reproduces every quantitative and formal claim in "Safety-Gated Reversible
  Denial: Recoverable Anti-Tampering for Crewless Merchant Ships": the
  exhaustive property check over five controller designs, the absorbing
  continuous-time Markov chain, the threshold analysis over heterogeneous
  holders, and the possession-duration derivation from the public NGA
  Anti-Shipping Activity Messages database.
